{"title": "Tactical Discipline", "pageid": 29797, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tactical_Discipline", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tactical_Discipline.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Tactical_Discipline.webp/300px-Tactical_Discipline.webp, /w/images/e/ef/Tactical_Discipline.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Tactical_Discipline.webp/300px-Tactical_Discipline.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Tactical_Discipline.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Tactical Discipline</b> is a passive feature that grants the user advantage on all ability checks and saving throws during combat.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You are an expert in mustering self-control to gain an edge over your foes. You gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on all <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> during combat. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aischa\" title=\"Aischa\">Aischa</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Aminah\" title=\"Aminah\">Aminah</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Anouk\" title=\"Anouk\">Anouk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Baalfe\" title=\"Baalfe\">Baalfe</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bagdog\" title=\"Bagdog\">Bagdog</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Borri_Paver\" title=\"Borri Paver\">Borri Paver</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chadd\" title=\"Chadd\">Chadd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Frode\" title=\"Frode\">Frode</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Garmin\" title=\"Garmin\">Garmin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gasper_Throaks\" title=\"Gasper Throaks\">Gasper Throaks</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Greyward\" title=\"Greyward\">Greyward</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gudrun\" title=\"Gudrun\">Gudrun</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hahns_Rives\" title=\"Hahns Rives\">Hahns Rives</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hertvor_Dremble\" title=\"Hertvor Dremble\">Hertvor Dremble</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hyrriet\" title=\"Hyrriet\">Hyrriet</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ifran\" title=\"Ifran\">Ifran</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ignur\" title=\"Ignur\">Ignur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Indora_Ralston\" title=\"Indora Ralston\">Indora Ralston</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Inocente_Bramm\" title=\"Inocente Bramm\">Inocente Bramm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jaxbock\" title=\"Jaxbock\">Jaxbock</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Liadan\" title=\"Liadan\">Liadan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lo\" title=\"Lo\">Lo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Maeve\" title=\"Maeve\">Maeve</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Malik_(iron_consul)\" title=\"Malik (iron consul)\">Malik (iron consul)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Marten_(iron_consul)\" title=\"Marten (iron consul)\">Marten (iron consul)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mian\" title=\"Mian\">Mian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mohlen\" title=\"Mohlen\">Mohlen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Moosk\" title=\"Moosk\">Moosk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nuff\" title=\"Nuff\">Nuff</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Numia\" title=\"Numia\">Numia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Polandulus\" title=\"Polandulus\">Polandulus</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sigurd\" title=\"Sigurd\">Sigurd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Stalwart\" title=\"Stalwart\">Stalwart</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Stijin\" title=\"Stijin\">Stijin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tamia_Holzt\" title=\"Tamia Holzt\">Tamia Holzt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ulova\" title=\"Ulova\">Ulova</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Unilda_Tiro\" title=\"Unilda Tiro\">Unilda Tiro</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Uva\" title=\"Uva\">Uva</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vlomina\" title=\"Vlomina\">Vlomina</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Volgu_Drak\" title=\"Volgu Drak\">Volgu Drak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Waldemar_Prinski\" title=\"Waldemar Prinski\">Waldemar Prinski</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wulf\" title=\"Wulf\">Wulf</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yoonce\" title=\"Yoonce\">Yoonce</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zana_Hade\" title=\"Zana Hade\">Zana Hade</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wi